**A. BACKGROUND**

Terre des Hommes Deutschland e.V. (TDH) is an international non-profit and non-governmental development organization based in Germany. TDH supports implementation of programmes in the Eastern, Western and Southern Africa regions through its Africa Coordination Office (AFCO).

