The purpose of this Terms of Reference (ToR) is to engage an independent and suitably qualified external audit firm to audit the financial statements and assess the financial management and internal control systems of the project for the financial years from **1 October 2026** to **September 2030.**

**B. SCOPE OF THE AUDIT**

These Terms of Reference address the requirement for an external audit of the financial statements of the JRS Project for the calendar year 2026, covering the period from **1 October 2026 to 30 September 2030**

The final signed audit report shall be submitted by **23 February every year**, and the Management Letter shall be submitted by **16 February every year**.

